{"title":"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) #7</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) #9</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The circle graph shows the favourite ice cream flavours of those surveyed. What fraction of people surveyed selected either chocolate or strawberry as their favourite flavour of ice cream?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/b/1fb37f4e53f003612246b8735ca6a602cc41f6af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{3}{5} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{1}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{2}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{3}{4} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\frac{5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"408\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we can figure out the percentage of people that chose either flavor by adding the percentages together:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/2972b837ea473a40b1eaaae0ee78b02dba8d31a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\% + 10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/7/fd7edd3842c40dbc1e54e522917a6e07b43c92e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>We can now turn this percentage into a fraction, and then reduce the fraction:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/2/932dd16618ac91469452d69b1171b623ed0fe26b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60\\% = \\frac{60}{100} = \\frac{60 \\div 20}{100 \\div 20} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{3}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"271\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can turn the percentages of people that chose chocolate ice cream as their favorite, as well as strawberry, and add them together, and then simplify the ending fraction:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/41027f18b9742a2112352ff9d20a5f29759c76a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\% = \\frac{50}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/8992fe09f246a54f94b893f8201f473ba8404b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\% = \\frac{10}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/8/0d8295776283e98392c586057066a238f838706b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{50}{100} + \\frac{10}{100} = \\frac{60}{100} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{3}{5}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"226\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2008 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-alig